OL,3,GNEWSAArrest made after man threatened
OL,4,Aand gun fired
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Ffirearm offences after a gun was fired
OL,8,Fin Barnsley.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police was called to
OL,11,FSmithies Lane at about 22:05 BST on
OL,12,FSaturday to reports of gunshots, with a
OL,13,Fman allegedly threatened during the
OL,14,Fincident.
OL,16,FNo injuries were reported, with a
OL,17,F39-year-old man later arrested in
OL,18,FHarrogate, North Yorkshire. He
OL,19,Fcurrently remains in custody, the force
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
